 "description": "<p>Seven pieces make this the most complete maid set in the category: headdress, neck ring, arm rings, bra, panties, skirt, and apron, in red spandex, one size for 40-60 kg. Lolita proportioning - fuller skirt, more trim - is what separates it from the minimal versions.</p>\n<p>Spandex rather than chiffon changes the fit character: it stretches through every piece, which matters when a set has this many components that each need to sit right. The apron ties over the skirt at the waist.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: spandex</li>\n<li>Includes: headdress, neck ring, arm rings, bra, panties, skirt, apron</li>\n<li>Style: Lolita maid</li>\n<li>Color: red</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, recommended 40-60 kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>One size for 40-60 kg. The full-rig option - every accessory accounted for in a single purchase.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Red spandex Lolita maid set with seven pieces from headdress to apron, one size for 40-60 kg.</p>\n",
